    __fixtures__/              # HTML fixtures for extractor tests
  lib/
    supabase_client.mjs
    nigeria_heuristic.mjs
    upsert.mjs
```

## supabase/functions/ (Tier 2 + 4 — gitignored, deploy via CLI/MCP)

```
supabase/functions/
  _shared/
    supabase_admin.ts          # sole service-role reference
    nigeria_heuristic.ts
    upsert.ts
  ingest-devpost/index.ts
  ingest-dorahacks/index.ts
  ingest-mlh/index.ts
  ingest-custom-search/index.ts
```

Scheduled via `supabase/migrations/*_cron_jobs.sql` (pg_cron + pg_net).
